OL,3,GNEWSABBC commentator thanks Cardiff
OL,4,ACity legend for saving him after heart
OL,5,Aattack scare
OL,6,
OL,7,FA football commentator has thanked
OL,8,FNathan Blake for saving him when he had
OL,9,Fa suspected heart attack after a game.
OL,11,FRob Phillips had just finished covering
OL,12,FCardiff City's last-gasp defeat to
OL,13,FBolton earlier this month, when he
OL,14,Fstarted experiencing severe chest
OL,15,Fpains.
OL,17,FHe intended to drive home to south
OL,18,FWales from the Greater Manchester town,
OL,19,Fbut club legend Blake stepped in and
OL,20,Fsaid he wasn't going anywhere, seeing
OL,21,Fthat he had lost all his colour.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
