OL,3,GNEWSABBC commentator thanks Cardiff
OL,4,ACity legend for saving him after heart
OL,5,Aattack scare
OL,6,
OL,7,FVeteran commentator Phillips was still
OL,8,Flaughing and joking when he was taken
OL,9,Fto see the Bolton club doctor, who
OL,10,Fcasually told him: "I think you're
OL,11,Fhaving a heart attack."
